#: build/blocks/ask-ai/index.js:305
msgid "Ask us anything"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/ProSet.php:761
msgid "An instant answer from our own FAQs, with the sources it used."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/ProSet.php:773
msgid "Can I use it on client sites?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/ProSet.php:774
msgid "What is the refund policy?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:56
msgid "Which size am I?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:57
msgid "Measure your chest and waist and read them off the chart, rather than going by the size you usually take. Ours run a little generous through the shoulder."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:59
#: includes/Templates/ShowcaseSet.php:803
msgid "Start here"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:63
msgid "Between two sizes?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:64
msgid "Take the smaller one in knitwear and the larger in outerwear. Knits relax with wear; a coat has to close over a jumper."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:69
msgid "Will it shrink?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:70
msgid "Everything is pre-washed, so no more than a percent or so. Wash cool and dry flat and it will hold its shape."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:75
msgid "What if it does not fit?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:76
msgid "Send it back within thirty days, unworn, and we pay the postage. Exchanges for a different size ship the same day we receive it."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:81
msgid "Do you alter?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:82
msgid "Trousers and jackets, free, in any of our shops. Allow three working days, or a week in December."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:87
msgid "Are the sizes UK or EU?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:88
msgid "UK on the label, with EU and US on the chart. If you are ordering from outside the UK, go by the measurements."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:94
msgid "Size & Fit Guide"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:99
msgid "Size and fit"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:100
msgid "The six things people ask before ordering. All of it on the page — no clicking."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:130
msgid "Do I need a visa?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:131
msgid "It depends on your passport, not on us. We send the requirement for your nationality with the booking confirmation, and again a month before you fly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:133
msgid "Check first"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:137
msgid "Any vaccinations?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:138
msgid "None are compulsory on any of our trips. Two are recommended for the desert itinerary — ask your GP eight weeks ahead, not two."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:143
msgid "Cash or card?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:144
msgid "Cards work in the cities and nowhere else on three of the four trips. Bring enough cash for a week and top up when you can."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:149
msgid "How much can I bring?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:150
msgid "One bag of twenty kilos and a daypack. On the walking trips a porter carries the large bag, so weight matters more than size."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:155
msgid "What is the weather like?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:156
msgid "Each itinerary lists the average high, low and rainfall by month. We only run trips in the months that read well."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:161
msgid "Is insurance included?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:162
msgid "No, and you cannot travel with us without it. Medical cover and repatriation are the two parts we check."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:168
msgid "Before You Travel"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:173
msgid "Before you travel"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:174
msgid "The paperwork and the packing, in the order people worry about them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:207
msgid "Which dishes contain nuts?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:208
msgid "Three on the current menu, all marked. The kitchen is not nut free, so we will not tell you that traces are impossible — we will tell you exactly which surfaces and pans are shared."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:212
msgid "Can a dish be made without them?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:213
msgid "Two of the three, yes, and it is cooked separately. The third is built on a nut base and we would rather say no than serve you something risky."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:220
msgid "What is gluten free as it comes?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:221
msgid "Eleven dishes, marked on the menu. The bread and two of the puddings are the only things that cannot be adapted."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:225
msgid "Is it coeliac safe?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:226
msgid "We use a separate fryer and separate boards, and flour is handled at the other end of the kitchen. Tell your server it is coeliac rather than a preference and the ticket is flagged."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:233
msgid "How many dishes are vegan?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:234
msgid "Nine, and six of them are on the menu because they are good rather than because they are vegan. The small plates section is almost entirely plant based."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:238
msgid "Is the wine list vegan?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:239
msgid "Most of it. The list marks the four that are not, all of them fined with egg white."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:245
msgid "Nuts"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:246
msgid "The kitchen is not nut free. Here is exactly where they appear."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:252
msgid "Gluten"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:253
msgid "What is safe as it comes, and what we can adapt."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:258
msgid "Vegan and vegetarian"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:259
msgid "Nine vegan dishes, and an honest note about the wine."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:264
msgid "Something else"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:265
msgid "Ring us before you book rather than asking on the night. The kitchen can plan around almost anything with a day's notice."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:288
msgid "Allergens & Dietary"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:329
msgid "How many sessions will I need?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:330
msgid "Four to six for most people, spread over a couple of months. You should feel a difference by the second — if you do not, we will say so and refer you on."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:334
msgid "Do I need a scan first?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:335
msgid "Usually not. Imaging changes the plan in fewer than one case in ten, and an unnecessary scan tends to find something harmless that then worries you."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:342
msgid "Is it worth it if I am older?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:343
msgid "Age is not the deciding factor — how much you move already is. Our oldest patient last year was eighty-four and finished the programme."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:347
msgid "Will I need surgery eventually?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:348
msgid "Sometimes, and we will tell you when we think so rather than selling you sessions first. Getting stronger beforehand improves the outcome either way."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:355
msgid "How soon can I train again?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:356
msgid "Something on the first day, almost always — modified, not nothing. Complete rest is the slowest way back for most injuries."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:360
msgid "Do you work with my coach?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:361
msgid "Gladly, with your permission. The programmes that hold are the ones where the coach knows what we have asked for."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:367
msgid "Back and neck"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:368
msgid "The most common reason people come to us, and the one with the most myths attached."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:374
msgid "Joints and arthritis"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:375
msgid "What is realistic, and when we would send you elsewhere."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:380
msgid "Sports injuries"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:381
msgid "Getting back to it, sooner than resting would allow."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:386
msgid "Not sure which applies"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:387
msgid "Book a fifteen-minute call. It is free, it is with a clinician rather than a receptionist, and it often ends with us telling you that you do not need us."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:415
msgid "Treatment Explorer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:456
msgid "How often, and for how long?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:457
msgid "Three sessions a week for twelve weeks, forty-five minutes each. Missing one is fine; missing a fortnight means starting the block again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:461
msgid "Do I need a gym?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:462
msgid "From week five, yes, or a barbell at home. The first four weeks need a floor and a pair of bands."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:469
msgid "How fast will I lose weight?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:470
msgid "Half a kilo a week is the honest answer and the one that lasts. Anything faster is mostly water and comes back."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:474
msgid "Do I have to count calories?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:475
msgid "Only if it suits you. Most people do better on portion habits and stop tracking within a month either way."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:482
msgid "I have never run before"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:483
msgid "Then start on the walk-run weeks rather than skipping them. Everyone who gets injured in the first month skipped them."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:487
msgid "Can I train for a specific race?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:488
msgid "Yes — give us the date and the distance and the block is built backwards from it, with a taper that actually tapers."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:494
msgid "I want to get stronger"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:495
msgid "Twelve weeks, three sessions a week, measurable at the end."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:501
msgid "I want to lose weight"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:502
msgid "Slower than the internet promises, and it stays off."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:507
msgid "I want to run further"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:508
msgid "From nothing to a distance, or from a distance to a faster one."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:513
msgid "I do not know yet"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:514
msgid "Come in for an assessment. It costs nothing, takes half an hour, and ends with a recommendation you can take elsewhere if you want to."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:519
msgid "Programme Explorer"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:524
msgid "What are you training for?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:525
msgid "Pick the goal and the programme underneath it explains itself."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:561
msgid "Fixed price or day rate?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:562
msgid "Fixed, wherever the work can be described. Day rate only for open-ended discovery, and we will tell you which one applies before you ask."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:566
msgid "What is the smallest project you take?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:567
msgid "About a week. Below that the writing-it-down costs more than the work, and you are better off with someone hourly."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:571
msgid "When do we pay?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:572
msgid "A third to start, a third at the halfway review, a third on handover. No invoice arrives before the thing it covers exists."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:579
msgid "What counts as a change?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:580
msgid "Anything that moves the date or the price. Reworded copy and a different shade of blue do not; a new page does."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:584
msgid "How is it agreed?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:585
msgid "A note saying what it is, what it costs and what it moves, and your reply. Nothing is started on a verbal yes in a meeting."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:591
msgid "How you charge"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:592
msgid "Fixed price against a written scope, in three payments."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:598
msgid "When things change"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:599
msgid "They will. Here is what happens when they do."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:604
msgid "What we need from you"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:605
msgid "One person who can decide, and content by the date we agree. Late content is the single most common reason a project slips."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:609
msgid "Who owns the work"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:610
msgid "You do, including the source, from the moment the final invoice clears. There is no licence to renew and nothing held back as leverage."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:615
msgid "Scope & Pricing"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:620
msgid "Scope, change and cost"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:621
msgid "The commercial questions, answered before you have to ask them twice."
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:660
msgid "Can I cancel?"
