msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:730
msgid "What makes an offer stronger than a higher one?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/Templates/SectorSet.php:731
msgid "Being ready. A mortgage in principle, a solicitor instructed and no chain beats several thousand pounds more from someone who has none of those."
