#: build/ask-ai-promo/index.js:75
msgid "“Can I get my money back?” and “What is your refund policy?” mean the same thing to a person and nothing to a keyword search. So every entry can carry a list of the other ways people ask it, and each one is matched against on its own while pointing at the same answer. It is the cheapest way to make the assistant feel like it understands your visitors — and it costs nothing per question, because a match this good never needs the AI at all."
