#: build/ask-ai-promo/index.js:79
msgid "Analytics tells you which of your FAQs got read. This tells you what people wanted to read and could not find — in their own words, ranked by how many asked. You are no longer guessing which FAQ to write next; the list writes itself, and every entry you clear is one less support e-mail forever."
